"# Home

Status: changed (a proposed change to a screen the app already has).

## Phone (390×844)

Image: \`home.phone.png\`

Note on the whole screen: Home is the start screen

- Title "My notes"
- Horizontal stack
  - Primary button "Sort"
    - → opens Settings Page
  - Primary button "Filter"
- List row "Wrapped"
- Vertical stack
  - List row "Shopping", subtitle "3 items", → chevron (opens a screen)
    - → opens Settings Page ("List settings")
    - Note: Swipe left to delete
  - List row "Ideas", → toggle (on)
- Grid (3 columns)
  - Primary button "A"
  - Primary button "B"
- Text "Hello"
- Shape (rectangle)
- List row "Bottom nav", → chevron (opens a screen) — pinned to bottom
- Primary button "+" — floating, bottom right
  - Note: Creates a new note

## Desktop (1440×900)

Image: \`home.desktop.png\`

- Title "My notes"
- Horizontal stack
  - Primary button "Sort"
  - Primary button "Filter"
- List row "Wrapped"
- Vertical stack
  - List row "Shopping", subtitle "3 items", → chevron (opens a screen)
  - List row "Ideas", → toggle (on)
- Grid (3 columns)
  - Primary button "A"
  - Primary button "B"
- Text "Hello"
- Shape (rectangle)
- List row "Bottom nav", → chevron (opens a screen) — pinned to bottom
- Primary button "+" — floating, bottom left

## Opened from

- Settings Page ("Settings" heading)
"
`;

